      "props": {
        "Code": "Dim p = in_Rect.Trim(\"\"\"\"c, \"[\"c, \"]\"c).Split(\",\"c)\nDim r = New Double(4) {} : For k = 0 To 4 : r(k) = Double.Parse(p(k), System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) : Next\nDim s = r(4)\nDim x = CInt(r(0) * s), y = CInt((r(1) - 32) * s), w = CInt(r(2) * s), h = CInt((r(3) + 32) * s)\nDim bmp As New System.Drawing.Bitmap(w, h)\nUsing g = System.Drawing.Graphics.FromImage(bmp) : g.CopyFromScreen(x, y, 0, 0, bmp.Size) : End Using\nbmp.Save(in_Path, System.Drawing.Imaging.ImageFormat.Png) : bmp.Dispose()"
      },
